### EcoTrack API — HTTP requests for VS Code REST Client / IntelliJ HTTP Client
### Set @baseUrl and @token before running

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080
@token = Bearer <paste-jwt-here>

### ── Auth ──────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "senha": "yourpassword"
}

### ── Usuários ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register user
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Samuel Teixeira",
  "email": "samuel@example.com",
  "senha": "strongpassword123"
}

### Get current user profile
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/me
Authorization: {{token}}

### List users (admin)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get user by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Update user
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "nome": "Samuel T.",
  "email": "samuel@example.com"
}

### Delete user
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/usuarios/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### ── Viagens ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register trip
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/viagens
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transporte": "METRO",
  "distanciaKm": 12.5,
  "data": "2026-04-20"
}

### List my trips
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/viagens?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get trip by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/viagens/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Update trip
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/viagens/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "transporte": "BICICLETA",
  "distanciaKm": 5.0,
  "data": "2026-04-20"
}

### Delete trip
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/viagens/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### ── Compensações ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Register carbon offset
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/compensacoes
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "ARVORE_PLANTADA",
  "quantidade": 2,
  "data": "2026-04-20"
}

### List my offsets
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compensacoes?page=0&size=10
Authorization: {{token}}

### Get offset by id
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/compensacoes/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### Update offset
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/compensacoes/1
Authorization: {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "tipo": "ARVORE_PLANTADA",
  "quantidade": 3,
  "data": "2026-04-20"
}

### Delete offset
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/api/compensacoes/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### ── Insights (AI) ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Get AI sustainability insight for user
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/insights/1
Authorization: {{token}}

### ── Actuator ────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Liveness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/liveness

### Readiness probe
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health/readiness

### Full health (authenticated)
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/health
Authorization: {{token}}

### Prometheus metrics
GET {{baseUrl}}/actuator/prometheus
Authorization: {{token}}
